cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: molentropy
abstract: >-
  Estimates the configurational entropy of a molecule from a molecular dynamics
  trajectory in internal coordinates, with nearest-neighbor mutual information
  expansion, mutual information spanning tree, quasi-harmonic, Boltzmann
  quasi-harmonic and split soft/hard estimators.
authors:
